{"type":"message","id":"18742f01","parentId":"adcae6bc","timestamp":"2026-06-04T10:26:59.747Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-06-04 10:26 UTC] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: Publish the current story to WordPress as a DRAFT. Use the raw markdown at /tmp/crypto-run-20260604-100328/article/final.md, the validated research at /tmp/crypto-run-20260604-100328/research/validated.json, and the feature image at /tmp/crypto-run-20260604-100328/media/feature.jpg. Run the publishing script. Yield back ONLY the string \"WP_SUCCESS\"."}],"timestamp":1780568819716}}
